---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../Footer.astro';
import { getLangFromUrl, useTranslations, useTranslatedPath } from '../../i18n/utils';

const lang = getLangFromUrl(Astro.url);
const t = useTranslations(lang);
const translatePath = useTranslatedPath(lang);
---
<Layout>
  <Nav />
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-[48rem] px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-24">
    <a href={translatePath('/')} class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-body hover:text-ink transition-colors mb-8">← Back to Compass</a>
    <h1 class="font-sans text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink mb-2">{t('page.terms.title')}</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-mute font-mono mb-8">Last updated: October 2026</p>
    <p class="text-body text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Please read these Terms and Conditions ("Terms") carefully before using onlinecompass ("the Service"). By accessing or using the Service, you agree to be bound by these Terms.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-sans text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink mt-10 mb-4">1. Use of the Service</h2>
    <p class="text-body text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">
      onlinecompass is provided free of charge for personal and professional use. You may use the Service to find compass direction, level surfaces, measure speed, and find qibla. No registration or payment is required.
    </p>
    <p class="text-body text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">You agree not to:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-body text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">
      <li>Use the Service for any unlawful purpose</li>
      <li>Attempt to reverse-engineer, scrape, or copy the Service for redistribution without permission</li>
      <li>Interfere with or disrupt the servers or networks that host the Service</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="font-sans text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink mt-10 mb-4">2. Accuracy Disclaimer</h2>
    <p class="text-body text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">
      onlinecompass is designed to provide accurate readings when properly calibrated. However, accuracy depends on:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-body text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">
      <li>Correct calibration by the user</li>
      <li>The physical characteristics of your specific device</li>
      <li>Browser zoom level (measurements assume 100% zoom)</li>
      <li>Screen scaling settings in your operating system</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-body text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">
      <strong>Do not rely on onlinecompass for safety-critical measurements</strong> — such as medical, engineering, or construction applications where measurement errors could cause harm. For precision work, use calibrated physical instruments.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-sans text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink mt-10 mb-4">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
    <p class="text-body text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">
      The design, code, text, and visual assets of onlinecompass are owned by us and protected by copyright law. You may not reproduce or redistribute them without prior written permission. The measurement functionality of the Service — using a device's sensors as a compass — is not claimed as proprietary; only our specific implementation is protected.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-sans text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink mt-10 mb-4">4. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
    <p class="text-body text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">
      The Service is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, either express or implied. We do not warrant that the Service will be uninterrupted, error-free, or completely accurate for all devices and screens.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-sans text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink mt-10 mb-4">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p class="text-body text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">
      To the fullest extent permitted by law, we shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising out of your use of, or inability to use, the Service — even if we have been advised of the possibility of such damages.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-sans text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink mt-10 mb-4">6. Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p class="text-body text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">
      The Service may contain links to third-party websites. These links are provided for convenience only. We have no control over third-party content and accept no responsibility for it.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-sans text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink mt-10 mb-4">7. Changes to These Terms</h2>
    <p class="text-body text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">
      We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page will reflect the most recent revision. Your continued use of the Service after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the revised Terms.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-sans text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink mt-10 mb-4">8. Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-body text-base leading-relaxed">
      Questions about these Terms? <a href={translatePath('/contact/')} class="text-link hover:underline">Contact us here</a>.
    </p>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>